      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Looking down is the universal sign for \"in the menu\" in VRC \n\nAdding a \"in the menu\" text will clog the environment too much and be a distraction\n\nA solution would be a possible \"in menu\" animation slot, so you can have a cool custom animation",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
